# API Resources

- Public endpoints return Resources, never raw Eloquent models.
- Keep catalog read-only/public until auth is intentionally added.
- Expose `image_url` for display; keep `image_ref` for compatibility when present.
- Do not leak `provider` / `external_id` in public catalog JSON.
- Eager-load relations in services/controllers before Resource collections.
